  Index: 3
  Information: 'Prisoner was linked by DNA to a 24 year old unsolved murder.

    The
    sole evidence is a receipt left on the ground at a private estate which he does
    not own. But honestly we''re just happy to close a cold case.

    This prisoner
    was coincidentally serving time due to loitering.

'
  Charges:
  - Trespassing
  - Murder
  - Loitering
  Sentence: 2
